{
 "title": "if let 和 while let",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "如果你只关心一个变体，可以写 **`if let`** 来代替 `match`：模式匹配时，它会绑定到变量并运行代码块，否则运行 `else`。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    maybe: Optional[i32] = Valid(42)",
    "    if let Valid(x) = maybe:",
    "        print(\"found\", x)",
    "    else:",
    "        print(\"nothing\")",
    "",
    "    none_here: Optional[i32] = None",
    "    if let Valid(y) = none_here:",
    "        print(\"found\", y)",
    "    else:",
    "        print(\"nothing\")"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "found 42",
    "nothing"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "只要模式匹配，**`while let`** 就会循环。`List.pop()` 在列表取空之前给出 `Valid(元素)`，之后给出 `None`。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    stack = List[str]()",
    "    stack.push(\"first\")",
    "    stack.push(\"second\")",
    "    stack.push(\"third\")",
    "    while let Valid(item) = stack.pop():",
    "        print(\"popped:\", item)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "popped: third",
    "popped: second",
    "popped: first"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c08-l05-x1",
   "prompt": "用 `while let` 和 `pop` 逐个取出 `nums` 列表中的数字，并输出它们的总和。",
   "starter": [
    "fn main():",
    "    nums = List[i32]()",
    "    nums.push(4)",
    "    nums.push(5)",
    "    nums.push(6)",
    "    total = 0",
    "    print(total)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn main():",
    "    nums = List[i32]()",
    "    nums.push(4)",
    "    nums.push(5)",
    "    nums.push(6)",
    "    total = 0",
    "    while let Valid(n) = nums.pop():",
    "        total += n",
    "    print(total)"
   ],
   "hint": "在 `while let Valid(n) = nums.pop():` 中执行 `total += n`。",
   "expected": [
    "15"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c08-l05-q1",
   "q": "`while let` 什么时候停止？",
   "options": [
    "10 轮之后",
    "当模式不再匹配时（例如 `pop()` 给出 `None`）",
    "从不"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "匹配失败时循环结束。"
  }
 ]
}
